- [Screenshot of full page](docs\evidencias\mcp-360-dark.png)
### Ran Playwright code
```js
// Screenshot full page and save it as docs\evidencias\mcp-360-dark.png
await page.screenshot({
  fullPage: true,
  path: 'docs\\evidencias\\mcp-360-dark.png',
  scale: 'css',
  type: 'png'
});
```

### Result
{
  "persistedTheme": "dark"
}
### Ran Playwright code
```js
await page.evaluate('() => { const theme=document.documentElement.dataset.theme; if(theme!==\'dark\' || localStorage.getItem(\'devlinks-theme\')!==theme)throw Error(\'Persistencia falhou\'); return {persistedTheme:theme}; }');
```

